  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Declare FULL rigor (bff-api + spe; xhigh; sonnet). Load the knowledge files + bff-extensions.md + design §5 + the as-built-inventory eTag-mismatch note. Read the `ComposeService` create-on-save path + `SpeFileStore` create/write. State the Placement Justification. Run `/conflict-check`.</step>
